      "text": "打包\n构建",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "XDUORkklCNZnXRSG0ax4D",
      "originalText": "打包构建",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Xo9aNwESlUDfLCHihv1cZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -442.5859928461383,
      "y": -159.29836465064423,
      "width": 723.1133315803313,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1625740614,
      "version": 248,
      "versionNonce": 1043424666,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792126748405,
      "created": 1792123467250,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CI(持续集成):开发人员提交代码，构建工具会自动将代码拖出来做构建；构建完\n成后，再被测试工具部署到测试环境做自动化测试，有问题再打回到开发人员修\n改，然后再次提交代码",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CI(持续集成):开发人员提交代码，构建工具会自动将代码拖出来做构建；构建完成后，再被测试工具部署到测试环境做自动化测试，有问题再打回到开发人员修改，然后再次提交代码",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RVD8XFUPjy-y0eeu7shQj",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1495.5768777590733,
      "y": 103.835354,
      "width": 53.685661661644644,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
