      "text": "交付",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "RVD8XFUPjy-y0eeu7shQj",
      "originalText": "交付",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RIfgBoZ5F7C6w1xQ4LIxx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1077.8258056645984,
      "y": -301.80259844677005,
      "width": 723.1133315803313,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 636596486,
      "version": 159,
      "versionNonce": 1400129306,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792126756442,
      "created": 1792123831042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CD(持续交付 Delivery)：运维能自动实现从某个平台（文件服务|仓库）获取打包\n构建好的最终产品",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CD(持续交付 Delivery)：运维能自动实现从某个平台（文件服务|仓库）获取打包构建好的最终产品",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "t60Q-WPQJgATZ-2VcsWTl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1081.7473348170288,
      "y": -197.333716418359,
      "width": 723.1133315803313,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 905447174,
      "version": 146,
      "versionNonce": 1593124358,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792126760718,
      "created": 1792124018022,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CD(持续部署 Deployment)：有工具能自动将打包构建好的产品拖出来，自动发布\n到线上生产环境",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CD(持续部署 Deployment)：有工具能自动将打包构建好的产品拖出来，自动发布到线上生产环境",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uCTBpqedE9xCtFmKFv8LP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1801.6888931780593,
      "y": -273.2868704467701,
      "width": 723.1133315803313,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 377111046,
      "version": 333,
      "versionNonce": 227731994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792126764572,
      "created": 1792124129950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "此流程如果有问题能快速反馈给研发人员进行修复，然后再重复进行这一系列修复\n上线流程，它们都是通过一系列自动化流程实现的，那这个过程就可以被称作\ndevops，它打通了开发和运维的边界",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "此流程如果有问题能快速反馈给研发人员进行修复，然后再重复进行这一系列修复上线流程，它们都是通过一系列自动化流程实现的，那这个过程就可以被称作devops，它打通了开发和运维的边界",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Nz0Gy1LzNAQLWz_PXWLP6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1817.514198308834,
      "y": -172.3337158500482,
      "width": 723.1133315803313,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 898775706,
      "version": 347,
      "versionNonce": 1469733830,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792126767348,
      "created": 1792125931698,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "生产环境有很多不同的平台，Linux、Windows、cent5、6、7等等，使得构建和\n部署非常困难，但有了容器这个概念，使这个问题迎刃而解，也让devops落地实\n现成为可能",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "生产环境有很多不同的平台，Linux、Windows、cent5、6、7等等，使得构建和部署非常困难，但有了容器这个概念，使这个问题迎刃而解，也让devops落地实现成为可能",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0PW_tfQgBB_3XtkiDU2zE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -282.8104717178913,
      "y": 604.2673652036812,
      "width": 629.0708431458221,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 558608794,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 212550278,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792126743208,
      "created": 1792126302377,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "容器出现---devops迅速流行---容器编排成为重要底层基础工具\n容器编排工具自身并不能提供devops环境，更需要掌握了容器编排工具\n后，把devops的思想和文化作用于容器编排工具上",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "容器出现---devops迅速流行---容器编排成为重要底层基础工具\n容器编排工具自身并不能提供devops环境，更需要掌握了容器编排工具后，把devops的思想和文化作用于容器编排工具上",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eG1t5LgszozZl-ONwvAay",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -391.07596090853804,
      "y": 700.9563901261108,
      "width": 723.1133315803313,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 505208518,
      "version": 279,
      "versionNonce": 1227230214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792126733175,
      "created": 1792126513541,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "devops 并不是一种技术，而是一种文化、运动、趋势。也就是：以往我们需要手\n工解决问题，转为用工具、自动化的方式解决问题，突破dev和ops之间的屏障，\n让大家可以协同工作",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "devops 并不是一种技术，而是一种文化、运动、趋势。也就是：以往我们需要手工解决问题，转为用工具、自动化的方式解决问题，突破dev和ops之间的屏障，让大家可以协同工作",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
